    "tests": [
      "revokes another browser session and blocks its next authenticated request",
      "login, upload and execution use the real API and homologated fixture",
      "imports the real workbook families and keeps duplicate uploads idempotent",
      "shows internal notifications and persists individual and batch reads",
      "generates, views and safely exports a persisted report",
      "consults the resulting Workorder and expected pending queue",
      "assigns, returns, resubmits and approves with segregation of duties",
      "covers rejected upload and temporary API recovery",
      "expires a persisted session and redirects without leaking the resource",
      "does not render public login inside an authenticated shell",
      "enforces role and organization scope",
      "completes the administrative lifecycle with scoped associations",
      "supports English, keyboard navigation and a mobile viewport",
      "governs notification templates without changing historical occurrences"
